{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07356","headline":"灞东晚晴简同行薛弃朱训 · 刘长卿","name":"灞东晚晴简同行薛弃朱训","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客心豁初霁，霁色暝玄灞。\n西向看夕阳，曈曈映桑柘。\n二贤诚逸足，千里陪征驾。\n古树枳道傍，人烟杜陵下。\n伊余在羁束，且复随造化。\n好道当有心，营生苦无暇。\n高贤幸兹偶，英达穷王霸。\n迢遰客王程，裴回主人夜。\n一薫知异质，片玉谁齐价。\n同结丘中缘，尘埃自兹谢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}